## What Cline did most recently (June 23 2026)

### All 8 RRS and LES detail pages — created (commit 7aa81cf)

Created 8 new detail page components in `src/components/`:

**RRS (Retirement Risk Series) — 4 pages:**
- **RRSMarketRiskPage.jsx** — Market Risk: sequence-of-returns risk deep-dive, zero-floor protection solution, Harbourview FIA focus. Hero + 3 content sections + CTABanner.
- **RRSInflationRiskPage.jsx** — Inflation Risk: purchasing power erosion, tax-deferred compounding, index-linked crediting strategies. Hero + 3 content sections + CTABanner.
- **RRSLongevityRiskPage.jsx** — Longevity Risk: outliving savings statistics, guaranteed lifetime income, FIA income riders + MYGA accumulation. Hero + 3 content sections + CTABanner.
- **RRSInterestRateRiskPage.jsx** — Interest Rate Risk: reinvestment trap, bond price sensitivity, MYGA rate lock vs CD ladder. Hero + 3 content sections + CTABanner.

**LES (Life Events Series) — 4 pages:**
- **LESApproachingRetirementPage.jsx** — Pre-retirement window (5–10 years), accumulation-to-protection shift, MYGA + FIA pairing. Hero + 3 content sections + CTABanner.
- **LESMarketVolatilityPage.jsx** — Fear-driven decision-making, behavior gap, zero-floor FIA eliminates emotional triggers. Hero + 3 content sections + CTABanner.
- **LESFinancialWindfallPage.jsx** — Inheritance/sale proceeds/settlements, urgency trap, tax-deferred windfall management via MYGA. Hero + 3 content sections + CTABanner.
- **LESCareerTransitionsPage.jsx** — 401(k) rollovers, the default problem, IRA-held MYGA/FIA as rollover destination. Hero + 3 content sections + CTABanner.

**Page structure (consistent across all 8):**
- Hero: centered text with eyebrow row (blue dash + uppercase label) + h1 + subtitle
- Section 1: white bg, 2-col split — text left (icon tile + Eyebrow + h2 + body paragraphs), teal-tint card right (h3 + FeatureList)
- Section 2: navy bg (`var(--ov-navy-1000)`), Eyebrow + h2 + dark cards in 2-col grid
- Section 3: white bg, 2-col split — text left (Eyebrow + h2 + body + FeatureList + PillMint/PillGhost CTAs), image right
- CTABanner: tint bg section, shared CTABanner component

**Design compliance:**
- All inline style objects with design tokens (`var(--ov-ff-display)`, `var(--ov-ff-sans)`, `var(--ov-navy-1000)`, `var(--ov-surface-tint)`)
- FeatureList component with dark/light variants (matches hub page pattern)
- Card rules followed: teal-tint cards on white sections, dark cards on navy sections
- Shared components used: Eyebrow, CTABanner, PillMint, PillGhost (no raw buttons)
- Lucide icons: TrendingDown, Percent, DollarSign, ShieldCheck, Clock, BarChart2, Gift, Briefcase
- Responsive classes reused: `ov-section`, `ov-container`, `ov-split-row`, `ov-risk-grid`
- Build verified clean (`npm run build` — 1807 modules, no errors)

**What was NOT done (intentionally left for Claude Code):**
- Page.jsx route wiring (imports, switch cases, PAGE_ROUTES, titles)
- Header.jsx navigation links
- Hub card linking (RetirementRiskPage.jsx and LifeEventsPage.jsx cards still need links to their detail pages)
- index.html script updates
- tokens.css additions (none needed — existing responsive classes cover all 8 pages)

